er Co on YouTube","words":[[73.362,73.629],[73.682,73.789],[73.839,74.189],[74.269,74.749],[74.989,75.229],[75.269,75.389],[75.435,75.709],[75.789,75.949],[76.029,76.189],[76.259,76.749]]},{"key":"owned#3","text":"Example A customer signs up for emails and later receives an update about a new snack launch.","words":[[77.129,78.109],[78.549,78.989],[79.051,79.549],[79.602,79.869],[79.922,80.029],[80.069,80.189],[80.269,80.749],[80.829,81.069],[81.109,81.309],[81.362,81.789],[81.816,81.869],[81.926,82.269],[82.296,82.429],[82.469,82.509],[82.569,82.749],[82.816,83.149],[83.206,83.709]]},{"key":"owned#4","text":"Key concept Owned channels help brands maintain direct relationships with customers rather than depending entirely on social media or marketplaces .","words":[[84.129,84.909],[84.999,85.629],[85.776,86.509],[86.571,87.069],[87.101,87.229],[87.286,87.629],[87.682,88.109],[88.166,88.509],[88.56,89.229],[89.261,89.389],[89.445,89.949],[90.063,90.749],[90.781,90.909],[90.949,91.309],[91.38,91.949],[92.002,92.109],[92.166,92.509],[92.589,92.989],[93.096,93.309],[93.378,94.189],[94.229,94.269]]},{"key":"owned#explain","text":"In simple words: Today the brand also talks to customers through channels it controls, like its website, email and blog.","words":[[95.515,95.551],[95.597,95.871],[95.951,96.671],[96.724,96.991],[97.011,97.071],[97.124,97.391],[97.487,97.871],[97.924,98.191],[98.244,98.351],[98.399,98.831],[98.861,99.071],[99.115,99.471],[99.524,99.631],[99.693,100.591],[100.623,100.751],[100.791,100.911],[100.971,101.711],[101.791,102.191],[102.251,102.431],[102.527,102.991]]},{"key":"social#0","text":"One brand, four platforms","words":[[104.416,104.431],[104.498,105.151],[105.199,105.391],[105.471,106.191]]},{"key":"social#1","text":"Social media helps brands reach people, showcase products, and interact with potential customers.","words":[[106.877,107.391],[107.444,107.711],[107.764,108.031],[108.088,108.431],[108.471,108.671],[108.728,109.311],[109.364,109.