143.793],[143.853,144.033],[144.081,144.513],[144.58,144.993]]},{"key":"social#explain","text":"Think of it like this: On social media, one brand appears on four platforms: Instagram, YouTube, Facebook and LinkedIn.","words":[[145.9,146.033],[146.06,146.113],[146.14,146.193],[146.241,146.433],[146.497,146.833],[147.02,147.393],[147.45,147.793],[147.86,148.513],[148.573,148.753],[148.806,149.073],[149.123,149.473],[149.526,149.633],[149.697,149.953],[150.025,151.073],[151.137,152.153],[152.208,152.993],[153.037,153.393],[153.493,153.793],[153.855,154.432]]},{"key":"story#0","text":"Story, purpose, people","words":[[155.46,155.873],[155.973,156.674],[156.787,157.473]]},{"key":"story#1","text":"Customers are more likely to connect with a brand when they understand its story, purpose, and people.","words":[[158.221,158.833],[158.873,158.993],[159.025,159.153],[159.21,159.553],[159.58,159.633],[159.683,160.033],[160.065,160.193],[160.233,160.273],[160.326,160.593],[160.625,160.753],[160.785,160.913],[160.957,161.393],[161.453,161.633],[161.7,162.273],[162.323,162.913],[162.933,162.993],[163.062,163.593]]},{"key":"story#2","text":"Facing the Sharks? — Eat Better Co on YouTube","words":[[163.884,164.913],[164.933,164.993],[165.073,165.833],[165.973,166.113],[166.153,166.273],[166.319,166.593],[166.7,166.913],[166.966,167.073],[167.143,167.633]]},{"key":"story#3","text":"Invitation to book a kitchen tour","words":[[167.982,169.073],[169.126,169.233],[169.281,169.473],[169.513,169.553],[169.603,169.953],[170.017,170.513]]}]},{"audio":"/audio-chapters/2.2-2.mp3","steps":[{"key":"story#4","text":"Eat Better uses its founder story and YouTube content to communicate its journey. Its invitation to book a kitchen tour also provides an opportunity for customers to learn more about its operations.","words":[[0.21,0.24],[0.297,0.64],[0.704,0.96],[1,1.12],[1.17,1.52],[1.6,2],[2.04,2.16],[2.22,2.64],[2.7,3.12],[3.253,3.52],[3.56,4],[4.06,4.24],[4.29,5.08],[5.19,5.52],[5.578,6.16],[6.21